{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》熱播引發全城熱議，劇中飾演過氣童星林安安的鄺潔楹近期因演技問題飽受爭議。面對網民狠批在視后面前格格不入，她選擇以自嘲方式大方回應，同劇前輩楊茜堯及陳自瑤更雙雙出面護航。今晚（16日）即將播出她突破尺度的埋身肉搏戲碼，背後隱藏極大危機。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹遭批「戲屎」 楊茜堯陳自瑤齊開腔護航</h2>\n<p>鄺潔楹昨日出席商場宣傳活動時首度開腔回應外界對其演技稚嫩批評。她在台上以高情商化解尷尬場面，坦言如果自己演技精湛早就已經奪走各大演藝獎項。同場出席活動兩位前輩楊茜堯以及陳自瑤見狀隨即挺身而出為她護航，大讚她完全演活劇中過氣童星以及無工開奀星設定。三人在台上互動展現出深厚情誼，直接以行動打破外界對於同劇女星之間存在明爭暗鬥各種傳聞。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹6字自嘲回應批評：「我連提名都冇」</h2>\n<p>針對社交平台上湧現大量負評，鄺潔楹不但沒有迴避，更親自回覆網民留言剖白拍攝心聲。她直言：「係嘅，我拍個陣都好大壓力，但可以同前輩們一齊做戲真係好正，賺咗！」隨後接受訪問時她進一步大笑自嘲：「如果我有咁好，我早就攞獎啦！我連提名都冇！」她解釋林安安這個角色本來就帶點蠢鈍，一直處於下把位受人擺佈，希望觀眾能夠繼續追看後續發展。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹欠債接客上演親熱戲 突破尺度埋身肉搏</h2>\n<p>《玫瑰戰爭》今晚將會迎來劇情高潮，林安安因為欠下巨債最終被逼走上援交之路接客還錢。劇情交代她接客期間神情迷離兼不斷合眼傻笑，完美詮釋出吸毒後迷幻狀態，更與男演員上演多場極具視覺衝擊埋身肉搏、公主抱以及鴛鴦戲水等破格親熱場口。整個大尺度香艷過程原來早已被楊茜堯暗中派人全程偷拍錄影。相關極密親熱戲碼與偷拍片段將會在劇集中突然全面曝光。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹大方回覆演技負評　獲網民讚有風度</h2>\n<p>劇集播出至今網民對於一眾女演員表現評價呈現兩極化。部分觀眾早前留言直指鄺潔楹演技與其他女演員存在明顯差距，批評她與前輩同框時顯得格格不入。不過自從她公開自嘲並親自回覆負評後，大量網民紛紛轉軚留言支持，表示「你回得都好有風度，support你，繼續努力」。同時有不少觀眾開始對今晚播出大尺度突破性演出感到好奇，期待後續劇情發展。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11161_17656232776afae9dc06187.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 鄺潔楹在《玫瑰戰爭》飾演過氣童星林安安，演技表現引起網民討論。鄺潔楹笑言：「如果我有咁好，我早就攞獎啦！」以自嘲回應演技爭議。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1131\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11161_17656232776afae9dc06187.png\" width=\"931\"/></a><figcaption>鄺潔楹在《玫瑰戰爭》飾演過氣童星林安安，演技表現引起網民討論。鄺潔楹笑言：「如果我有咁好，我早就攞獎啦！」以自嘲回應演技爭議。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812716_y-1_12043001066afae9bd48c0d-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 鄺潔楹未有迴避負評，親自留言分享與前輩合作的感受。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812716_y-1_12043001066afae9bd48c0d-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>鄺潔楹未有迴避負評，親自留言分享與前輩合作的感受。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812715_y_7711282186afae9c0b34e8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812715_y_7711282186afae9c0b34e8.jpg\" width=\"720\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812718_y_15731651746afae9bb0ec09.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812718_y_15731651746afae9bb0ec09.jpg\" width=\"1007\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812719_y_4767436676afae9b8d9924-1024x935.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"877\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812719_y_4767436676afae9b8d9924-1024x935.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812720_y_13727363156afae9b5a9dd8-1024x1259.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1180\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6329868955299812720_y_13727363156afae9b5a9dd8-1024x1259.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482412770319618_8230302446afad7c032b30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 鄺潔楹劇中因欠債被逼接客，林安安的處境愈陷愈深。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482412770319618_8230302446afad7c032b30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>鄺潔楹劇中因欠債被逼接客，林安安的處境愈陷愈深。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482412944337759_14997203416afad7c1df113.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482412944337759_14997203416afad7c1df113.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482413137032246_18741053786afad7c3b908f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482413137032246_18741053786afad7c3b908f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482413289049243_6986130756afad7c53c7d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482413289049243_6986130756afad7c53c7d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482413355432136_17111198666afad7c5d9f67.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482413355432136_17111198666afad7c5d9f67.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482413417977987_16537265146afad7c68cba5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482413417977987_16537265146afad7c68cba5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948241357633519_11539528426afad7c8461ff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948241357633519_11539528426afad7c8461ff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:57:19.760019+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1344,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:45:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:43.421000+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:50:54.794340+00:00","content_hash":"6b2cbecdf9d5c433b473b67fc00dc84e65efd3f0d4d29bab17e1bd2efe6c031e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}